  "question": {
    "text": "If the inverse trigonometric functions take principal values, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
